    "summary": "Glass liquor bottle [a], covered in twined basketry, with metal screw cap [b]. The base and warp of sedge grass, the black body in maidenhair fern, and white designs in grass. The white designs have coloured motifs in green, orange and purple grass. Around the bottle neck are three designs in opposing triangles; on one side below are a pair of Haitlik, or Lightening Serpents, a Thunderbird and at the bottom, two whales. On the other side is an eagle and horse.",
